{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Industrial production index, calendar adjusted and seasonally adjusted, chain index, 2021=100 by industrial classification (NACE Rev. 2) and month","source":"Statistics Sweden","updated":"2026-09-10T06:00:00Z","note":["Methodological changes  \r\nIn connection with the publishing of April 2015 some methodological changes have been introduced. The time series have been calculated back to 2000 in order to decrease possible level shifts and breaks in the time series, which have resulted in revisions in some historical series.  \r\n  \r\nIn connection with the publication of reference month January 2021, methodological changes relating to the calculation of production in 07 (metal ore mines) and 30 (industry for other transport equipment) have been implemented. As a result, statistics for these activities and linked aggregates have been revised from January 2015 and onwards. \r\n  \r\n  \r\n  \r\nIn connection with the publication of reference month November 2021, methodological changes relating to the calculation of production in NACE 10-12 (food products, beverage and tobacco industry) NACE 19 (petroleum industry) and NACE 17.11 (pulp industry) have been implemented. As a result, statistics for these activities and linked aggregates have been revised from September 2014 and onwards.  \r\n  \r\n2024-11-08: When publishing the reference month September 2024, changes are implemented that aim to increase the quality of the statistics. The changes involve revisions, in most cases small, from April 2018 to August 2024 and affect the content of tables in the Statistical Database.  \r\n  \r\n2025-06-10: In connection with the publication of reference month April 2025, a methodological change will be introduced regarding the handling of VAT data when used as a source of turnover. The change will entail revisions from April 2019 onwards, in most cases very small and not sufficient to affect published statistical values. ","2025-02-10: In connection with the publication of the reference month December 2024, the statistics have been corrected for the periods April 2024 to November 2024. This after an error was discovered in the calculation of final statistics for the second and third quarter of 2024 (final statistics for a given month are published one to three months after the first publication for the month depending on the placement within the quarter). The error stems from the model calculation of the turnover of so-called annual filers, i.e. companies that, due to their turnover size, only need to declare VAT annually. The correction affects all industries.","2025-04-10: In connection with the publication of the reference month February 2025, the statistics for industry for chemical, chemical products and pharmaceutical products (NACE 20-21) and industry for motor vehicles, trailers and semi-trailers (NACE 29), as well as all aggregates where these industries are included, will be revised back to January 2023. This is because new data has been received by Statistics Sweden.","2025-05-09: In connection with the publication of the reference month March 2025, the statistics have been corrected for the industry of chemical, chemical products and pharmaceutical products (NACE 20-21), as well as all aggregates where these sectors are included. The correction concerns the reference month of September 2024.","2025-12-10: In connection with the publication of the reference month October 2025, the statistics for the industry of chemical, chemical products and pharmaceutical products (NACE 20–21) were revised, as well as all aggregates where these sectors are included. The revision concerns the reference month of June 2025. This is due to new information received by Statistics Sweden.","2026-09-10: In connection with the publication of the reference month July 2026, the statistics for Industry for motor vehicles, trailers and semi-trailers (NACE 29) have been revised for the period January 2025 to June 2026. The revisions also affect all aggregates that include the above-mentioned industry. This is due to new information received by Statistics Sweden.","2026-09-10: In connection with the publication of the reference month July 2026, the statistics for Industry for computer, electronic and optical products (NACE 26) have been revised for the period January 2026 to June 2026. The revisions also affect all aggregates that include the above-mentioned industry. This is due to new information received by Statistics Sweden."],"role":{"time":["Tid"],"metric":["ContentsCode"]},"id":["SNI2007","ContentsCode","Tid"],"size":[1,1,319],"dimension":{"SNI2007":{"label":"industrial classification (NACE Rev. 2)","category":{"index":{"B+C":0},"label":{"B+C":"mining, quarrying, manufacturing "}},"extension":{"elimination":false,"show":"code_value"}},"ContentsCode":{"label":"observations","category":{"index":{"NV0402AL":0},"label":{"NV0402AL":"Calendar adjusted and seasonally adjusted"},"unit":{"NV0402AL":{"base":"index","decimals":1}}},"extension":{"elimination":false,"refperiod":{"NV0402AL":""},"show":"value","measuringType":{"NV0402AL":"Flow"},"priceType":{"NV0402AL":"Fixed"},"adjustment":{"NV0402AL":"WorkAndSes"},"basePeriod":{"NV0402AL":"2021"},"alternativeText":{"NV0402AL":"Industrial production index, calendar adjusted and seasonally adjusted, chain index, 2021=100"}}},"Tid":{"label":"month","category":{"index":{"2000M01":0,"2000M02":1,"2000M03":2,"2000M04":3,"2000M05":4,"2000M06":5,"2000M07":6,"2000M08":7,"2000M09":8,"2000M10":9,"2000M11":10,"2000M12":11,"2001M01":12,"2001M02":13,"2001M03":14,"2001M04":15,"2001M05":16,"2001M06":17,"2001M07":18,"2001M08":19,"2001M09":20,"2001M10":21,"2001M11":22,"2001M12":23,"2002M01":24,"2002M02":25,"2002M03":26,"2002M04":27,"2002M05":28,"2002M06":29,"2002M07":30,"2002M08":31,"2002M09":32,"2002M10":33,"2002M11":34,"2002M12":35,"2003M01":36,"2003M02":37,"2003M03":38,"2003M04":39,"2003M05":40,"2003M06":41,"2003M07":42,"2003M08":43,"2003M09":44,"